title: Disco Shuffle in Twelve
key: Gm
tempo: 112
meter: 12/8
style: disco

// The floor in twelve-eight: four pulses to the bar, three eighths in each, at
// the dancer's speed. Sixteen bars, a verse and a chorus. The verse rocks
// between the one and the four, goes to the six, and comes home by the minor
// two-five. The chorus opens on the six and the seven, finds the one by the
// minor five, then takes a two-five to the relative major, steps from it to
// the six, and turns round by the minor two-five again.
[Verse]
| Gm9    | Cm9        | Gm9 | Cm9 |
| Ebmaj7 | Am7b5 D7b9 | Gm9 | %   |

[Chorus]
| Ebmaj7 | F9 | Dm7           | Gm9        |
| Cm9    | F9 | Bbmaj7 Ebmaj7 | Am7b5 D7b9 |
